# Always use Lumen (constitution)

On **every** request, before inventing UI or picking colours/spacing/type:

1. Read `.specify/memory/constitution.md` — **Principle I. Lumen Only** is non-negotiable.
2. Resolve visuals to Lumen tokens / components (`app/lumen.css`, Storybook-approved lumen components, Figma Lumen library). No raw hex, no detached Figma styles, no one-off primitives when Lumen already has the piece.
3. Also follow `.cursor/skills/lumen-betonline-build/SKILL.md` for live-site taste (shell, cards, inputs, claims, hovers).

If Lumen lacks something: stop and raise a component brief — do not improvise a parallel system.
